[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09_desc]
It is said that the by-products of the weather factory can be processed into muffins. Derpy decided to go and inspect it... Yes, just to inspect the operation of the factory, absolutely not to try the muffins!\n“Just asking, a question completely unrelated to this matter, can I try it when the time comes? No, no, I’m just asking, I’m not saying I want to try it!”\n“Not recommended? You said there are food safety risks without testing? So it’s just a risk, right? Then I can try it!”\n“Can’t? By the way, doesn’t the Duchess have the right to try it? I am the Duchess!”\n“What do you mean I already have a lot? I haven’t tasted the taste here yet! Pleeeeeease~”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about weather factory, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09_desc]
听说天气工厂的副产品里又可以加工成马芬的东西，呆蹄决定去视察一下... 对，只是视察工厂的运作情况，绝对不是为了试吃马芬什么的！\n“只是问一下，和此事完全无关的一个问题，到时候是可以试吃的吧？没有没有，我只是问问而已，不是说我要试吃！”\n“不建议？你说没经过测试有食品安全风险？所以只是风险对吧？那就是可以试吃了！”\n“不行吗？话说，公爵是不是有权利试吃一下？我是公爵诶！”\n“什么叫我已经有很多了？我还没尝过这里的口味啊！求求你了~”

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_09_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于天气工厂的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

